\noindent\hspace{0.125in}\textbf{\textit{Abstract}} --- \textbf{Blocks o' Code v3 is a modular tangible programming platform designed to introduce children to programming concepts through interactive physical blocks. The system uses ESP32-based processing, inter-block communication, display feedback, and audio output to create an engaging educational environment. Each block acts as part of a larger embedded system, allowing users to build logical sequences through physical interaction instead of relying only on screen-based coding. The project emphasizes modularity, ease of use, and classroom adaptability while addressing hardware integration challenges such as communication reliability, power distribution, and mechanical connectivity.}\par}
